# Normalise line endings in the repository.
#
# This template is cloned onto whatever machine the next site is built on, and
# without this a Windows checkout commits CRLF while a Linux one commits LF.
# The result is a diff where every line of a file has changed and none of its
# content has, which makes `git checkout template/master -- src/system/` (the
# supported way to pull a fix down) unreadable.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
